  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2da25f187c589b58864002571cd23ec815d6d01e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8d02e08b8066928bbb09565ac8c2e5337f25d99.png\"><br><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><strong>Project Babylon 是一套模組系列，致力於打造能完美協作的 RPG 生態系統。Jewelry 模組新增了寶石、插槽系統以及物品稀有度機制。</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8d02e08b8066928bbb09565ac8c2e5337f25d99.png\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f7f9bfc707238d5f771b48e42c10b193ae105317.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"267\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>此模組新增了什麼？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">20 種以上寶石。</span><br><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">物品稀有度。</span><br><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">寶石插槽系統。</span><br><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">附魔插槽系統</span><br><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">附魔說明。</span><br><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">物品鍛造。</span><br><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">3 款全新工作台。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3414c5657ade00d6149c0697cc76f0d2903bee86.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2044\" height=\"232\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">必要依賴模組：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-babylon-materials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project Babylon - Materials。</a><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cf42bdfe52bf5f1505283de054cd7779a5552511.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"117\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spellbooks。</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight。</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8ad1d230b8024e6136522ac323c1350c6ee3052.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"302\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">請問會支援 1.21.1 嗎？也許未來會考慮。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">請問會推出低版本移植版嗎？答案同上。<br><br><br></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d9f50b27c02bef8209a8297e727ab44261ed4c08_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"478\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">錯誤回報請至此處：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f955784714264932362%252f1507633160773439539\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/955784714264932362/1482312386139652248</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">或此處：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f1481294346933375100%252f1481325691718078484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/1481294346933375100/1481325691718078484</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
